WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.180
[Typewriter keys strike.]

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.150
[The carriage rolls a fresh proof into place.]

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.850 line:8%
Elias: He opened his hand.

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.200 line:8%
“Take the ribbon, Elias.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.980 line:8%
I didn’t get any further than this.”

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.190
[The revolver fires as each letter lands.]

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:21.210
[Planks settle across the fissure.]

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:24.410
[Ink shots echo through the press.]

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.450
[The Critic’s shears open. The revolver fires.]
